    "long_instructions": "# Plant Doctor: write rules\nA **rule** is an if/else decision that a person writes. Look at the plant data from AI Lab. Which feature tells you most about a sick plant?\n\n**Do this:** when **Help Me!** is clicked, use **if / else** to show **Sick** or **Healthy**.\n\nThen test all six plants. Write down the answer your rule gives for each one, and what you think is correct.",
